75,24.67-49.55,13.92-74.61.3-26.35-14.3-59.14-32.11-101.39,2.93A12,12,0,1,0,47.66,82.84Z"></path></svg><span class="gsd-fmt-name" id="gsd-fmt-wavelength-name">Wavelength</span></span></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="gsd-fmt-survey-name" tabindex="-1" class="gsd-fmt gsd-fmt--chips" data-format="survey"><span class="gsd-fmt-top"><span class="gsd-fmt-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="ws-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H128a12,12,0,0,1,0-24h88A12,12,0,0,1,228,128ZM128,76h88a12,12,0,0,0,0-24H128a12,12,0,0,0,0,24Zm88,104H128a12,12,0,0,0,0,24h88a12,12,0,0,0,0-24ZM79.51,39.51,56,63l-7.51-7.52a12,12,0,0,0-17,17l16,16a12,12,0,0,0,17,0l32-32a12,12,0,0,0-17-17Zm0,64L56,127l-7.51-7.52a12,12,0,1,0-17,17l16,16a12,12,0,0,0,17,0l32-32a12,12,0,0,0-17-17Zm0,64L56,191l-7.51-7.52a12,12,0,1,0-17,17l16,16a12,12,0,0,0,17,0l32-32a12,12,0,0,0-17-17Z"></path></svg><span class="gsd-fmt-name" id="gsd-fmt-survey-name">Survey</span></span></button></div></div><p class="gsd-blurb">Ask a question with one right answer. Everyone picks A, B, C or D; you reveal the answer and a scoreboard keeps count.</p></section></div><section class="gsd-step"><h3 class="gsd-step-h" id="gsd-set-label"><span class="gsd-step-n is-done" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="ws-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span>Question set</h3><div class="schs" data-testid="set-chooser" data-value="platform:space" data-theme="dark"><div class="schs-picked" role="group" aria-label="Question set"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="ws-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg><b class="schs-picked-name" title="Space Trivia">Space Trivia</b><span class="schs-dim">12 questions</span><span class="schs-own schs-own--off" title="Managed by Engage and shared with every organisation. Copy it to make changes.">Ready-made</span><button type="button" class="schs-btn schs-push">Change</button></div></div><p class="gsd-setlinks"><button type="button" class="gsd-setlink">Your question sets</button><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><button type="button" class="gsd-setlink">Make a new set</button></p></section><div class="form-group gsd-cats"><div class="gsd-cats-head"><span class="gsd-label" id="gsd-categories-label">Topics in this set</span><span class="gsd-cats-hint">Switch off any you want to skip.</span></div><div class="category-selection"><div class="category-button-grid" role="group" aria-labelledby="gsd-categories-label"><button type="button" class="category-button " aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Leadership, 20 questions"><span class="category-mark" aria-hidden="true">–</span><span class="category-name">Leadership</span><span class="category-count">20</span></button><button type="button" class="category-button selected" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Ops, 27 questions"><span class="category-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="category-name">Ops</span><span class="category-count">27</span></button></div><small class="dialog-help-text" aria-live="polite">1 of 2 topics · 27 questions</small></div></div><div><h3 class="gsd-optional-h">Optional — every one has a safe default</h3><details class="gsd-adv"><summary><span class="gsd-adv-k"><i class="gsd-chev" aria-hidden="true"></i>Advanced</span><span class="gsd-adv-s" data-testid="gsd-adv-summary">Using the defaults — questions shuffled; Workie adapts its voice and gives the standard Trivia summary.<span class="gsd-adv-open-only"> Change any of them here.</span></span></summary><div class="gsd-adv-body"><div class="gsd-adv-help"><button type="button" class="help-button help-button-inline help-button-small help-button-quiet" title="Help: Advanced" aria-label="Help: Advanced"><span class="help-button-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="ws-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M144,180a16,16,0,1,1-16-16A16,16,0,0,1,144,180Zm92-52A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128ZM128,64c-24.26,0-44,17.94-44,40v4a12,12,0,0,0,24,0v-4c0-8.82,9-16,20-16s20,7.18,20,16-9,16-20,16a12,12,0,0,0-12,12v8a12,12,0,0,0,23.73,2.56C158.31,137.88,172,122.37,172,104,172,81.94,152.26,64,128,64Z"></path></svg></span></button></div><h3 class="gsd-section">Questions</h3><div class="gsd-opt is-on"><label class="gsd-opt-head"><input type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="gsd-opt-name">Shuffle the question order</span><span class="gsd-opt-state" aria-hidden="true">On</span></label><p class="gsd-opt-does">Questions are drawn at random from the categories you picked, rather than in the order they were written.</p></div><div class="form-group"><label for="gsd-goal">Goal</label><div class="gsd-goal"><input id="gsd-goal" class="dialog-input" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="gsd-goal-help" value=""><span class="gsd-goal-unit">of 12 questions</span></div><small id="gsd-goal-help" class="dialog-help-text">Blank plays until you end the session. When the room reaches the goal, the stage and the remote tell you, and you can keep going.</small></div><h3 class="gsd-section">Workie</h3><div class="form-group"><label for="gsd-persona">Workie's voice</label><select id="gsd-persona" class="dialog-select"><option value="">Adapt to the session (recommended)</option><option value="coach">Coach — warm and direct</option></select><small class="dialog-help-text">Workie reads the room and picks its own register — playful for an icebreaker, analytical for a retro.</small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="gsd-prompt">Summary approach</label><select id="gsd-prompt" class="dialog-select"><option value="">The standard Trivia way (recommended)</option><option value="trivia-vj">Trivia — VJ</option></select><small class="dialog-help-text">How Workie sums up each round on the results screen — the shape and content, where the voice is only the register. You can change it mid-session; it applies from the next round.</small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="gsd-ai-context">Instructions for Workie</label><textarea id="gsd-ai-context" placeholder="Anything Workie must always do — e.g. ‘end every round with one question for the ops leads’" class="dialog-textarea" rows="2" maxlength="500"></textarea><small class="dialog-help-text">Workie follows these in every round’s summary. Facts about the session belong in Event details, below. 0/500 characters</small></div><h3 class="gsd-section">What people see when they join</h3><div class="form-group"><label for="gsd-details">Event details</label><textarea id="gsd-details" placeholder="What this session is for, in a sentence or two." class="dialog-textarea" rows="2" maxlength="300"></textarea><small class="dialog-help-text">Shown to people on the screen they land on after joining. Workie reads it too. 0/300 characters</small></div></div></details></div>"`;

